🚀 Quick Start (Automatic – Windows only) 

   Double-click run.bat in the foodbridge folder.

   Three terminals will open – leave them open.
   Your browser opens http://localhost:3000 automatically.


   🖥️ Manual Start (Any OS)
    1. Start MongoDB
       Open a terminal and keep it running:
         mongod
  
    2. Start the Backend
       Open another terminal:
         cd foodbridge/backend
         go mod tidy
         go run main.go
           You should see:
                Connected to MongoDB!
                Server running on http://localhost:8080
    3. Serve the Frontend
       Open a third terminal:
         cd foodbridge/frontend
         python -m http.server 3000


Go to http://localhost:3000 in your browser.
keep all terminals open.
